            "review_title": "Review at Kichi Kichi",
            "review_text": "Mark R\n12 contributions\n0\nA terrible experience\nAug 2024 • Couples\nThis was our first hot pot experience, and might be our last.\n\nThe staff seemed uninterested to help. I had to ask for implements several times before anything arrived. In the meantime, my wife and I were struggling to eat the hotpot. It was clear we were a source of amusement to one staff member as she was laughing at our expense.\n\nThe food itself had a flavourful broth, but that's where it stopped. The conveyor belt options were definitely more miss than hit.\n\nIn the end we paid nearly $50 AUD for a below average meal and terrible service. Do yourself a favour and stay away from this restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 28, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
