            "review_text": "Pathfinder705778\n50 contributions\n0\nGood value, fun concept\nSep 2018 • Family\nWe never had hot pot on a conveyer belt, it was a funny first experience. Very convenient to have your own hot pot, ideal if you're vegetarian. The mushroom broth was delicious, but a little too bland. The speed of the conveyor belt was also too fast, and the buffet was a little disappointing. The vegetable range was good. Price was also ok, too, just such a pity that the cocktails were sold out.\nRead more\nWritten September 3, 2018",
