            "review_text": "tydeee\nBangkok, Thailand119 contributions\n0\nAvoid this place\nDec 2016 • Solo\nUnless you love terrible service by inept servers. It's the morons leading the morons food is okay. Nothing to rave about but because the service is so terrible, you might not ever get a chance to eat. Most restaurants in Saigon can't help but hire servers who have very little motivation to do anything more than the basic requirements of their job. You're lucky if you get that here. It's not rocket science but apparently for the management here it is. Go elsewhere. You'll thank me.\nRead more\nWritten December 18, 2016",
